  scenarioTitle: Parcel Delivery Notice
  introNarration: Another text. You weren't expecting any parcels today.
  senderName: AusPost
  messageBody: Your parcel could not be delivered. A $3.20 redelivery fee is required.
    Pay now or your parcel will be returned to sender.
  embeddedUrl: https://ausposst-redelivery.com/pay
  correctAction: 0
  isLegitimate: 0
  correctFeedback: Spotted it! The domain misspells 'auspost' as 'ausposst' and uses
