  incorrectFeedback: This was a typosquatting scam. Australia Post's real domain
    is auspost.com.au. The attacker added an extra 's' to trick you.
  redFlags:
  - Misspelled domain (ausposst vs auspost)
  - Wrong TLD (.com instead of .com.au)
  - Requesting payment via SMS link
  - Unexpected / unsolicited message
  difficultyLevel: 2
